{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302370","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130237001:1":{"text":"네, 요즘 전투장에서 다양한 개인전과 단체전 대결이 열리거든요.","source_cn":"是的，武斗场在近期安排了很多场角斗士单人对战和团队对战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8F58A7AADB7DA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130237002:1":{"text":"사람들이 군가 축제의 분위기에 푹 빠질 수 있도록 보여 드리는 공연 같은 거예요. ","source_cn":"这些对战属于表演性质，主要目的是让大家更沉浸于战歌节的气氛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DCBA435B2752C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130237003:1":{"text":"마음에 드는 전사의 승리를 예측하거나 직접 전투에 참여할 수도 있어요.","source_cn":"客人可以选择下注自己喜欢的勇士，也可以直接参与到对战中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D4C671BD881FA9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:员工亚丝":{"text":"직원 애스","source":"员工亚丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}